            "stars": 574
          }
        },
        {
          "node_type": "item",
          "title": "🌟XUMM 📱 Pronounced \"sum\" - XUMM is a self-custodial wallet for Android & iOS, built by XRPL-Labs. XUMM can hold many accounts, and is easy to setup. It strives to deliver the best XRPL experience. It has several features not found in any other wallet, including Tangram integration and xApps which are vetted by the XRPL-Labs team. XRPL-Labs/XUMM-App",
